# AI Overview Presence — {{ tracked_domain }}, query set {{ query_set_version }}, {{ window_start }} to {{ window_end }}

## Query set and window
- query_set_version: {{ query_set_version }} (adding or removing a query starts a new version and a new window)
- tracked_domain: {{ tracked_domain }}; included_subdomains: <list or none>
- window_start / window_end: {{ window_start }} / {{ window_end }} (window_end = window_start + 55 days for 8 weeks)
- weeks_observed: <1-8>

## Scrape configuration (fixed for the whole window)
- adapter: {{ adapter }}
- country / language / device: {{ country }} / {{ language }} / mobile or desktop
- logged_out: true
- aio_available_checked: true (AI Overviews confirmed available for this country and language before week 1)

## Queries (at least 20, one target URL each on the tracked domain)

| query | target_url |
|---|---|
| <query> | https://{{ tracked_domain }}/<path> |

## Rows (one per query per week; scraped on the same weekday within 48 hours; a failed scrape is status missing with nulls, never filled in)

| query | week | observed_at | status | aio_present | citations | our_domain_cited (host match only) | selected_snippet | panel_position |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| <query> | <1-8> | <YYYY-MM-DD> | observed | true | <every cited URL> | <true only if a citation host is the tracked domain> | <text> | <n> |
| <query> | <1-8> | <YYYY-MM-DD> | observed | false | | false | null | null |
| <query> | <1-8> | null | missing | null | | null | null | null |

## Metrics (per week and for the window)

| name | scope | week | value | unit | numerator | denominator |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| aio_presence_rate | week / window | <n or null> | <present / observed> | ratio | <present> | <observed queries> |
| our_citation_rate | week / window | <n or null> | <cited / present> | ratio | <cited> | <present panels> |
| median_panel_position | week / window | <n or null> | <median> | count | null | <present panels> |

## Findings (each names a metric and the period; co-occurrence only; no click or impression change attributed to the panel)

| metric | text | co_occurrence_only | causal |
|---|---|---|---|
| <metric name> | <sentence naming the metric, the period and, if shown, the co-occurring Search Console movement> | true | false |

## Retrofit list (only after 8 weeks; aio_present in at least 5 of 8 weeks and our_domain_cited false in each of the last 4; ranked by impressions)

| query | target_url | weeks_present | uncited_last_4_weeks | impressions | cited_domains |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| <query> | <target URL> | <5-8> | true | <n> | <domains the panel cites instead> |
